DESCRIPTION:Location: Skyland/South Buncombe Library - 260 Overlook Rd. - Asheville<br>Phone: [phone removed]<br>Email: redacted@example.invalid<br>Event Type: Arts & Crafts<br>Age Group: Adult<br>Library: Skyland / South Buncombe<br>Link: https://www.buncombecounty.org/governing/depts/library/branch-locations/skyland-south-buncombe.aspx<br><br>Bring your needles or your hooks and join us for some friendly company as you work on your current project.&#160\; No registration necessary\; just come by the Skyland Library community room with a love of yarn!<br> <br> Please note this is not a class -- we welcome knitters and crocheters of all skill levels\, but there might not be anyone on hand to teach the basics if you&#39\;ve never tried before.&#160\; Feel free to come and chat or observe\, though!
